#
# wick's fragment on upstream's CI guest kernel configuration
# (lib/firecracker/resources/guest_configs: microvm-kernel-ci-<arch>-<version>.config,
# ci.config, nvme.config, efi.config), read last by tools/linux/guest-kernel.sh:
# the guest end of host folder sharing (docs/design-fs.md, row 21). Upstream's
# configurations have CONFIG_FUSE_FS=y and "# CONFIG_VIRTIO_FS is not set".
# No DAX (CONFIG_FUSE_DAX): wick offers no DAX window (design-fs row 10).
# guest-kernel.sh fails if a line here is not in the built .config as written.
CONFIG_FUSE_FS=y
CONFIG_VIRTIO_FS=y
